tive","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:90882","source":"vndb"}]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_c10483","characterName":"山城 あかり","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"18200","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"49685"}],"egsCharacterIds":["81"],"vndbCharacterId":"c10483"},"originalCharacterName":"山城 あかり","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The protagonist's childhood friend and and student council president, she has earned the trust of both students and teachers. With the new business philosophy, in a very short time she became the daughter of the president of a large enterprise. Her parents adopted the orphan protagonist so their relationship is like that of siblings, and so she can be overprotective because she loves him so much."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c10483"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"斬新なアイデアを打ち出し、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"またたく間に大企業にまで成長したモバイル制作会社のご令嬢。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"学園では学生会会長を務め、教師や生徒からの信頼も厚い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"山城の名に恥じぬ娘であろうと、常に自分を律する女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公とは幼馴染であり従妹の関係。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"両親を早くになくした主人公を幼くから見守り支え、過保護なまでに愛を注いでくる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"81","sourceWorkId":"17428","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"斬新なアイデアを打ち出し、またたく間に大企業にまで成長したモバイル制作会社のご令嬢。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"学園では学生会会長を務め、教師や学生からの信頼も厚い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"山城の名に恥じぬ娘であろうと、常に自分を律する女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公とは幼なじみであり従妹の関係。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"両親を早くに亡くした主人公を幼くから見守り支え、過保護なまでに愛を注いでいる。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"18200"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/26/2655077c3da782f6a2a0ba59fa93d780ed911bfe89653eaceb58ea5a709d4bf5.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/69/6924841a3908acba21445e2a19aad1a5a435bdc23c397225fc0fabfc41aeb794.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"岡嶋妙","creatorId":"vndb:s359","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s359","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s359","name":"岡嶋 妙","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:49685:18200:4646:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c10484","characterName":"美作 日向","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"18201","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"49685"}],"egsCharacterIds":["82"],"vndbCharacterId":"c10484"},"originalCharacterName":"美作 日向","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Protagonist's classmate and best friend. Completely different from the honor student Akari, she advocates freedom and is graceful. Likes maids, and is even operating a maid cafe. When faced with something interesting she becomes very energetic, but when its something she isn't interested in, her reaction can be slow. When she heard about the protagonist getting married, she too wanted to marry him. All in said, she is just an ordinary relaxed otaku girl."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c10484"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"優等生のあかりとは正反対の、じつに自由人なゆるーい人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公とは同じクラスの同級生で、主人公とあかりのマブダチ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"じつはメイド好きが転じてメイド喫茶の経営をしちゃってる手腕の持ち主。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「今日っていう一日は明日っていう二日分の値打ちを持ってるんだよ！」と、自分の興味があることには、とことん一直線！"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"だけど、興味がないことにはかな～りゆるゆる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公が結婚すると聞いて「その設定気にいった！"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"あたしも結婚するよ！」と、やっぱりゆるーい感じで結婚を決めたり。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"いわゆるどこにでもいる典型的な、ゆる系の普通のオタク娘。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"82","sourceWorkId":"17428","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"優等生のあかりとは正反対に、実に自由人なゆるーい人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公とは同じクラスの同級生で、主人公とあかりのマブダチ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"実はメイド好きが転じてメイド喫茶の経営をしちゃってる手腕の持ち主。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「今日っていう一日は明日っていう二日分の値打ちを持ってるんだよ！」 と、自分の興味があることにはトコトン一直線！"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"だけど、興味が無いことにはかな～りゆるゆる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公が結婚すると聞いて 「その設定気にいった！　あたしも結婚するよ！」 と、やっぱりゆるーい感じで結婚を決めたり。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"いわゆるどこにでもいる典型的な、ゆる系の普通のオタク娘。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"18201"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c6/c63284ea242e5917a81c97d29c8c1d85cbee11457cba66444e8584edba104ae8.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0f/0f607ff8248d4af69208b228b441892152ba5193307a87a7d84022cf783aa9dc.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"新堂真弓","creatorId":"vndb:s1427","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1427","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1427","name":"新堂 真弓","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:49685:18201:6166:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c10485","characterName":"筑紫 優月","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"18203","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"49685"}],"egsCharacterIds":["84"],"vndbCharacterId":"c10485"},"originalCharacterName":"筑紫 優月","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Research institute director at the mobile company owned by Akari's parents and the protagonist's advisor. After the protagonist inherited the club, she participated in the development of new merchandise. Compact body paired with loose clothing, she is a girl with no dignity and always with a smile on her face."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c10485"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"あかりの親が経営するモバイル制作会社の開発研究所所長。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の良き仕事のアドバイザー。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"会社を継いでからは、新商品の開発を手伝ったりしてくれる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「この前なぁ、プリンに醤油かけて食べたらウニの味してん。これって大発見やんなぁ♪」"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"はんなりしたしゃべり口で、だけど言うことは正しい……のか、正しくないのか？"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"小さな体にダボダボの白衣で、ちっとも威厳がない、もへへーんとした女の子。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"84","sourceWorkId":"17428","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"あかりの親が経営するモバイル制作会社の開発研究所所長。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の良き仕事のアドバイザー。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"会社を継いでからは、新商品の開発を手伝ったりしてくれる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「この前なぁ、プリンに醤油かけて食べたらウニの味してん。これって大発見やんなぁ♪」"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"はんなりしたしゃべり口で、だけど言うことは正しい……のか、正しくないのか？"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"小さな身体にダボダボの白衣で、ちっとも威厳がない、もへへーんとした女の子。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"18203"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9d/9d9af100e6a025deddeccdcf7c90139daf47f7bc759e8dcd81f07a783f1aa5b6.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/78/78fb5252b4dfdae332bc246139d41b59ca8ae5f8e9988eff52d67400f74670f4.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"小林眞紀","creatorId":"vndb:s279","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s279","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s279","name":"小林 眞紀","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:49685:18203:5906:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c10582","characterName":"芳野 蛍","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"18202","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"49685"}],"egsCharacterIds":["83"],"vndbCharacterId":"c10582"},"originalCharacterName":"芳野 蛍","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The new mysterious transfer student that transferred at a strange time. When the protagonist created the baby club, in front of the club poster, she said \"so this poster is the beginning of everything\". She can magically tell the future like a seer as if she came from the future. She reveals quite a bit of the future and provides recommendations."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c10582"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"季節外れの転校生。下級生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ベイブを発足し、部員募集のポスターを前に"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「そう……このポスターが全ての始まりなのね？」と、不思議なことを口にしたり。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"未来を先読みができるという、有名な占い師を母親にもつためか問題が起きた時には、ちょっとだけ先の未来を口走ってアドバイスをくれたり。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"神秘的なオーラを身に纏ったミステリアスな転校生。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"83","sourceWorkId":"17428","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"季節外れの転校生。 下級生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ベイブを発足し、部員募集のポスターを前に 「そう……このポスターが全ての始まりなのね？」 と、不思議なことを口にしたり。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"未来を先読み出来るという有名な占い師を母親に持つためか、問題が起きた時にはちょっとだけ先の未来を口走ってアドバイスをくれたり。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"神秘的なオーラを身に纏ったミステリアスな転校生。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"18202"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/66/663452abac0bf5e1b3ddb228d65bce9d109bbfe7f4b05078083af8eee8f4014d.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/63/63279c4e6e9b4c42374f7ab82c7d5fcb56e1e5173a3e90d644e07e37d1bd25f6.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"田口宏子","creatorId":"vndb:s5","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s5","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s5","name":"田口 宏子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:49685:18202:5020:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c10583","characterName":"志摩 千陽","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"18204","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"49685"}],"egsCharacterIds":["85"],"vndbCharacterId":"c10583"},"originalCharacterName":"志摩 千陽","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"924"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The protagonist's homeroom teacher. Full of an adult's charm, she has very big boobs and has hair as strong and supple like that of a cat, but she is very afraid of trouble. She doesn't mind the current situation of the girls around her, but is still emotionally conflicted about her being unmarried. While the other teachers are opposed to bringing an infant to the school, she holds the opposite view and helps cover up for the protagonist. But because she thinks looking after a baby is too troublesome, that job is given to the other heroines. Hates the adult way of the world, she is just a childish teacher. Sensible but hates trouble, she is this kind of teacher."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c10583"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公のクラスの担任。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"巨乳で髪の毛クリクリの猫っ毛で。大人の魅力満載だけど、かなりの面倒くさがり。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"行き遅れを気にしてはいないが、未婚であることをネガティブに考えてる節がある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"他の教師が、学園に赤ん坊を連れてくることを反対したため"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"それに反対したくて主人公を積極的にかばったりする。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"だけど、やっぱり面倒みるのは面倒くさいので、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"外のヒロイン達にお世話を任しちゃったり？"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"大人の大人らしい部分が嫌い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"大人になりきれない子供先生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"一本気で筋を通すけど面倒くさがり。そんな先生。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"85","sourceWorkId":"17428","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"tex